{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261029/photo/bkn-20261029220049588-1029_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261029163603\"/><p>德國領事館舊址極具異國風情。</p><p>湖北武漢市政府大院內的德國領事館舊址始建於1895年，極具異國風情，被市民稱為「小白樓」，去年10月18日起免費向公眾開放，成為全國大城市中獨一份開放政府大院內部老建築參觀的案例。內媒周四（29日）報道，截至本月下旬，該百年洋房已累計接待遊客4,200餘人，因預約極度火爆而引發關注。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T14:42:29.567885+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T14:00:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T14:58:15.699739+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T14:39:16.952594+00:00","content_hash":"c1c5816f81ec8dbeba0e1657b60d1b945dbc7bd2284ee72d94311d5bfd467357","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T14:42:29.567885+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}